# Sanctuary Fortress 06_cliff_spiderballguardian layer 13: the Spider Guardian (ISBG e0014007a,
# CIngSpiderballGuardian) loads a few hundred frames after `layer 13` and starts inactive (its layer-3 trigger activates it; the FSM is set up on the first active Think) and patrols the AIWP
# chain from 00140022. The console activates it, hits it with each weapon, stuns it (stunned hit
# points 40), lets the stun (25 s) and charge (15 s) timers run out, sends the IM00-IM05 messages
# its relays send, walks the six puzzle phases, brings it to the player, kills it and deletes it.
# For tools/cov/specs/isbg.py.
@f300 god 1; layer 13; give missile 50; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give powerBomb 5
@f900 objs IngSpiderball
@f1000 send e0014007a Activate
@f1060 obj e0014007a
@f1300 obj e0014007a
@f1400 damage e0014007a 5 0 power
@f1430 obj e0014007a
@f1460 damage e0014007a 5 0 bomb
@f1490 obj e0014007a
@f1520 damage e0014007a 5 0 missile
@f1550 obj e0014007a
@f1580 damage e0014007a 50 0 bomb
@f1610 obj e0014007a
@f1700 damage e0014007a 5 0 bomb
@f1730 obj e0014007a
@f3200 obj e0014007a
@f3300 send e0014007a InternalMessage4
@f3330 obj e0014007a
@f3400 damage e0014007a 5 0 bomb
@f3430 send e0014007a InternalMessage5
@f3460 obj e0014007a
@f4300 obj e0014007a
@f4320 send e0014007a InternalMessage0
@f4340 damage e0014007a 5 0 bomb
@f4360 send e0014007a InternalMessage1; send e0014007a InternalMessage2; send e0014007a InternalMessage3
@f4380 codecall e0014007a EnableEnergyBar
@f4400 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4500 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4600 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4700 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4800 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4900 codecall e0014007a BeginNextPuzzleSection
@f4920 obj e0014007a
@f5000 place e0014007a player 1
@f5100 obj e0014007a
@f5200 kill e0014007a
@f5240 obj e0014007a
@f5400 send e0014007a Deactivate
@f5450 send e0014007a Delete
@f5500 objs IngSpiderball
